<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bistro Grand Soleil | ビストログランソレーユ</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        /* デザイン設定：イエロー＆ブラウン */
        :root {
            --primary-yellow: #f4d03f;
            --deep-brown: #4e342e;
            --accent-gold: #d4af37;
            --bg-cream: #fffdf5;
            --text-main: #333;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "Hiragino Sans", Meiryo, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-cream);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* ヒーローエリア */
        header {
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550966842-30c29a244831?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1600') center/cover no-repeat;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo-area h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        }

        .logo-area p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        /* セクション共通 */
        section {
            padding: 80px 20px;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h2 {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--deep-brown);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-yellow);
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            left: 50%;
            position: relative;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }

        /* メニュー表 */
        .menu-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .menu-box {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary-yellow);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .menu-box h3 {
            color: var(--deep-brown);
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .menu-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        /* 店舗情報・予約 */
        .info-area {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: var(--deep-brown);
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }

        .tel-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background-color: var(--primary-yellow);
            color: var(--deep-brown);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 50px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .tel-btn:hover {
            background-color: white;
        }

        iframe {
            width: 100%;
            height: 400px;
            border: none;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .menu-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .logo-area h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo-area">
            <h1>Bistro Grand Soleil</h1>
            <p>ビストログランソレーユ</p>
            <p style="border-top: 1px solid white; display: inline-block; padding-top: 10px;">旬の素材を活かした、フランス料理</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="menu">
        <h2>Menu</h2>
        <div class="menu-container">
            <div class="menu-box">
                <h3>Lunch Course</h3>
                <div class="menu-item"><span>Course A</span><span>¥3,000</span></div>
                <div class="menu-item"><span>Course B</span><span>¥4,000</span></div>
                <div class="menu-item"><span>Course C</span><span>¥10,000</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-box">
                <h3>Dinner Course</h3>
                <div class="menu-item"><span>Course A</span><span>¥5,000</span></div>
                <div class="menu-item"><span>Course B</span><span>¥6,500</span></div>
                <div class="menu-item"><span>Course C</span><span>¥10,000</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="info-area">
        <h2>Reservation & Access</h2>
        <p>ご予約はお電話にて承っております</p>
        <a href="tel:00-0000-0000" class="tel-btn"><i class="fas fa-phone"></i> 00-0000-0000</a>
        <p>【営業時間】 ランチ 11:30-14:30 / ディナー 18:00-22:00<br>【定休日】 火曜日</p>
        
        <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3240.8280303808788!2d139.7649361!3d35.6811673!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x0!2zMzXCsDQwJzUyLjIiTiAxMznCsDQ1JzUzLjgiRQ!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1612345678901!5m2!1sja!2sjp"></iframe>
    </div>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 Bistro Grand Soleil. All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
